_:n9d9d6b7ea95949829467ede8f8f34903b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:namespace must reference a valid RML Namespace.\n        " .
_:nd578829923ad4d1b97cc05b7ff3965d0b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:iterator specifies the iterator to iterate over\r\n        the data source, and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
_:n001a415395c047c190e2f6ec5249fe30b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reference" .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        An ObjectMap element to generate the object component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        An inner join of the logical view.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLChildMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
