<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetSubjectsOf> <http://w3id.org/rml/subject> .
_:n0736518d99aa4dc688f5fdaba4f21b82b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:N2f63325d0af640c2af59bccaeb661f6b <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N85fd369422f4472482e446aa1746ec07 .
_:n940c2b19e3fd4e69a04f5cc4da5c2ef2b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b3 .
_:n001a415395c047c190e2f6ec5249fe30b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A reference rml:reference is used to refer to a column in case of \n        databases, a record in case of CSV or TSV data source, an element in \n        case of XML data source, an object in case of a JSON data source, etc.\n\n        A reference must be a valid identifier, considering the reference \n        formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) specified. The reference can be\n        an absolute path, or a path relative to the iterator specified at the \n        logical source. \n        " .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n9520004cead149af8d5d6238c2aa1f63b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/termType> .
_:nab762737a89b42c787227cf8ad589c58b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/constant> .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple.\n        " .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be either rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, rml:UnsafeURI, rml:Literal, or rml:BlankNode for a Term Map.\n        May only be provided once.\n        " .
_:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#pattern> "^((?:(en-GB-oed|i-ami|i-bnn|i-default|i-enochian|i-hak|i-klingon|i-lux|i-mingo|i-navajo|i-pwn|i-tao|i-tay|i-tsu|sgn-BE-FR|sgn-BE-NL|sgn-CH-DE)|(art-lojban|cel-gaulish|no-bok|no-nyn|zh-guoyu|zh-hakka|zh-min|zh-min-nan|zh-xiang))|((?:([A-Za-z]{2,3}(-(?:[A-Za-z]{3}(-[A-Za-z]{3}){0,2}))?)|[A-Za-z]{4})(-(?:[A-Za-z]{4}))?(-(?:[A-Za-z]{2}|[0-9]{3}))?(-(?:[A-Za-z0-9]{5,8}|[0-9][A-Za-z0-9]{3}))*(-(?:[0-9A-WY-Za-wy-z](-[A-Za-z0-9]{2,8})+))*(-(?:x(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})+))?)|(?:x(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})+))$" .
_:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab3 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b15 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
_:n940c2b19e3fd4e69a04f5cc4da5c2ef2b6 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "parent" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLXPathReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A structured XPath reference formulation, used when XML namespaces need\n    to be declared for the references. rml:XPath without namespaces is used\n    otherwise.\n    " .
_:n9e36a715bcee4b17bc1f70ac2d9c9a33b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        The value of a rml:field property for a rml:Field must be a resource.\r\n        " .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/UnsafeIRI> .
_:nab762737a89b42c787227cf8ad589c58b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "rml:constant of a LanguageMap must be a plain string, not a language-tagged literal." .
_:n940c2b19e3fd4e69a04f5cc4da5c2ef2b12 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
_:n3845d86d1a1d4912b823c19fe8d99ee2b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:N8ac712ff8cad43fd8b938596166dbf30 .
_:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab7 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specified the language map for the object component for the \n        generated RDF triples.\n        " .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "predicateMap" .
_:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b31 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateMap> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n940c2b19e3fd4e69a04f5cc4da5c2ef2b7 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab26 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Two distinct fields in this view's effective field set (its own fields plus any introduced by leftJoin/innerJoin) share the same rml:fieldName." .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b10 .
_:n937aaedc63e846be99d12e4e57c90071b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple\n        " .
_:n940c2b19e3fd4e69a04f5cc4da5c2ef2b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nd578829923ad4d1b97cc05b7ff3965d0b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b16 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/FieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n9e36a715bcee4b17bc1f70ac2d9c9a33b1 .
_:n52f75c3b976f4f0680d8f5e71aa34c54b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/targetView> .
_:n63e0e799f8364073a34c46c309c4c7bab1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:language/rml:languageMap and rml:datatype/rml:datatypeMap\n        may only be provided once and not at the same time.\n        " .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab15 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab16 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLStrategyShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Strategy" .
_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateMapShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLNamespaceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A rml:Namespace declares the prefix and URL for an XML namespace used in\n    XPath references.\n    " .
_:n918867acce404e69aefc8f413524bcfbb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/UnsafeIRI> .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:N8ac712ff8cad43fd8b938596166dbf30 .
_:n9e36a715bcee4b17bc1f70ac2d9c9a33b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n9e36a715bcee4b17bc1f70ac2d9c9a33b12 .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalView, with either an rml:ExpressionField or an rml:IterableField its value.\n        " .
_:n474b4fb984df4247bf65f6c3d4a145a5b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/UnsafeURI> .
