_:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:PredicateObjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n       The value of a rml:structuralAnnotation property must be a resource.\n        " .
