_:n2fea76d6775b4afea8f8ecc2a0d0f261b5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A PredicateMap element to generate the predicate component of the \n        (predicate, object) pair from a logical table row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b9 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLanguageMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:LanguageMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference, or rml:constant\n    with the BCP47 name of the language as string.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLXPathReferenceFormulationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n9d9d6b7ea95949829467ede8f8f34903b5 .
