<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical view (rml:LogicalView) is a type of abstract logical source that is derived from another abstract logical source by defining fields with data from said abstract logical source.\n    " .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab18 .
_:n78e267baa3104fe5a58bec390ae6a43ab3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        A left join of the logical view.\n        " .
