<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n001a415395c047c190e2f6ec5249fe30b3 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    An abstract construct to describe data access and iteration for a data source.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    A leaf expression field is an expression field without nested fields.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n937aaedc63e846be99d12e4e57c90071b2 .
