<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Subject Map must generate a resource representing the subject of\n    an RDF triple.\n    " .
_:nd578829923ad4d1b97cc05b7ff3965d0b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The reference formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) defines how to\r\n        reference to elements of the data of the input source.\r\n        " .
_:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateObjectMap> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLChildMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:ChildMap must specify a literal referencing data in the child data\n    source.\n    " .
_:n4fd4f640440d42b185237ae617d66cc4b30 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
